==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on latest version, October 1st, 2021-->
Celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''7 Years of The Battle Cats'''}}'''!!'''<br>
Thank you so much for all your support since 2014! We couldn't have done it without all of our amazing players! Time to celebrate with the biggest and craziest set of special events, capsules and rewards yet!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Enjoy 7th Anniversary events from September 17th (11am) through October 15th (11am)!'''}}


{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Get ANOTHER chance at the Wildcat Slots and get BIG Cat Food rewards!'''}} One more try at the Slots! Get all 7s and earn a jackpot of Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available October 1st (12:00am) thru October 15th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Tap the {{Color|#008000|'''Wildcat Slots'''}} tab at the top of the Cat Base menu during this event to see if how lucky you'll get! Prizes of at least {{Color|#FF0000|'''777 Cat Food'''}} as a special service, only during this event!<br>
Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 17th (11am) and October 15th (11am)'''}}, limited unit [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]] is available for direct purchase in a super value pack including Cat Food and XP!

※ The Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●First Time Draw Discount Restart!'''}}<br>
All players get a half-off discount on the Cat Food cost of their first Rare Capsule draw following this 7th Anniversary reset! Your first {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Single Draw'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food) will cost only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
And your first {{Color|#FF00CC|'''11-Capsule Draw'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food) will cost you only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''750 Cat Food!'''}}

※ If the First Time discount fails to appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※Please be aware that received characters are randomly chosen; Uber Rares are not guaranteed during this event.<br>
※One single draw and one 11-draw may be made at the discounted Cat Food cost above. Cat Food costs will return to normal following these draws.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 4 different special Anniversary Sale Packs to buy!'''}}<br>
Stock up on Cat Food and other awesome items with these spectacular sales!<br>
The "Thank-You Pack" and the Silver, Gold and Platinum "Limited Sale" packs are available for a short time only {{Color|#FF00FF|'''between October 1st (11am) and October 15th (11am)'''}}

Get tons of Cat Food, Rare Tickets, and more during these limited sale events!<br>
These super deals will only be around for a short time, so don't miss out!

※ Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If the Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs fail to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collect a Platinum Ticket to celebrate 7 Years of Battle Cats fun!'''}}<br>
Complete a special anniversary mission to clear {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Empire of Cats Ch. 1'''}}, then head to the Catnip Challenges Special Missions section to claim your prize of one {{Color|#FF0000|'''Platinum Ticket'''}},, that can be exchanged for a draw of one guaranteed Uber Rare hero at the Rare Capsule machine!<br>
Take on other anniversary event-only Special Missions as well for extra rewards!

※ After completing the mission, you must claim your prize at the Catnip Challenges before October 15th, 2021 (11:59pm). If you do not claim your prize before then, you will not be able to earn the reward.<br>
※ Even players {{Color|#008000|'''who have already cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 1 can collect this reward!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●  Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 7th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge! Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier on October 15th! Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
Plus, collect bonus rewards for completing the dojo mission at the Catnip Challenges!

※ 7th Anniversary dojo mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 15th, 2021 (11:59pm). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. It may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If Dojo events do not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Challenging Limited Special Stages appear in one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Irregularly appearing Limited Special stages are coming one after the other between {{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 1st (12:00am) and October 15th (10:59am)'''}}

Check the schedule below!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Deeply Dreaming'''}}<br>
October 1st (12:00am) thru October 3rd (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・River Styx'''}}<br>
October 3rd (11:00am) thru October 5th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Blue Impact'''}}<br>
October 5th (11:00am) thru 7th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Queen's Coronation'''}}<br>
October 7th (11:00am) thru 9th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Dead on Debut'''}}<br>
October 9th (11:00am) thru 11th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・King Wahwah's Revenge'''}}<br>
October 11th (11:00am) thru 13th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Clionel Ascendant'''}}<br>
October 13th (11:00am) thru 15th (10:59am)

Can you withstand the gauntlet of giants?! Clear the stages and earn limited Cat Unit rewards!<br>
Plus, get extra rewards by clearing Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!

※ All Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on October 15th (11:59pm).

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 7th Anniversary Event All Stars map: Super Present DX!'''}}<br>
A limited addition to the Event All Stars series of special maps, available only for a limited time! Collect awesome item rewards on stage clear!<br>
Seasonal enemies stand in your way! Can you fight them off? Earn victory to pick up {{Color|#FF0000|'''super useful battle items!'''}}<br>
Until {{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 15th, 2021 at 10:59am'''}}, challenge this map at the times below:<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''6:00am~8:59am / 12:00pm~2:59pm / 7:00pm~10:59pm'''}}

Plus, earn {{Color|#0563C1|'''30 Cat Food'''}} each time you clear an All-Stars stage for the first time!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 7th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Challenge the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Birthday Present!'''}} map to earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} reward on your first clear each day.<br>
The stage rewards will {{Color|#008000|'''reset once each day at 12:00am'''}}, so clear it again and again until the end of the event to pick up a daily Cat Food prize!<br>
If you clear the stage each and every day of this event, you can pick up a {{Color|#FF0000|'''max total of 580 Cat Food!'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|If you include daily login stamp rewards, you can get a}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''total of 830 bonus Cat Food'''}} from this anniversary campaign!<br>
Plus, don't miss out on the Birthday Present mission in the Catnip Challenges!

※ 7th Anniversary mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 15th (11:59pm). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cybear's Vengeance Returns for the 7th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time!<br>
Clear the stage when it appears at the time below and you'll pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 17 (11:00am) thru September 23, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 24 (12:00am) thru September 30, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 1 (12:00am) thru October 7, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 8 (12:00am) thru October 15, 2021 (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''The stage can be cleared and rewards collected once during each event period!'''}}<br>
Plus, the very first time you clear this stage, you will collect a bonus reward of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limied Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on the limited edition stage  {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the limited  unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Catburger'''}}]]!<br>
Then visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to take on the limited awakening stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catburger Awakens!"'''}} for a chance to claim the power of {{Color|#FF0000|Catburger's third form}}!

※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen!<br>
※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}}  for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
September 17th (11:00am) thru September 30th (11:59pm)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
October 1st (12:00am) thru October 15th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catfruit'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''Item Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Item Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
September 17th (11am) thru September 30th (11:59pm)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
October 1st (12:00am) thru October 15th (10:59am)

※The Catfruit Item Capsules provide Catfruit, XP and various battle item rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes, XP and battle items!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Daily Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00CC|Treasure Festival, all day every day!}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|On}} {{Color|#008000|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00CC|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days'''}} {{Color|#1ECCFF|head to}} {{Color|#FF00CC|Into the Future}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00CC|Cats of the Cosmos}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''9/19, 9/22, 9/25, 9/28, 10/1, 10/4, 10/7, 10/10, and 10/13!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 50% Off Cat Food Discount on Special Cats'''}}<br>
Pick up all the Special Cats at half the cost and expand your strategic potential!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sale Period 1: September 17 (11:00am) thru September 19, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sale Period 2: September 24 (12:00am) thru September 26, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sale Period 3: October 1 (12:00am) thru October 3, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sale Period 4: October 8 (12:00) thru October 10, 2021 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Complete your collection by taking advantage of this special offer!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Daily Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app each day to collect a new login stamp and unlock awesome rewards of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cat Food, Rare Tickets'''}} and more during this anniversary campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day to pick up the maximum total rewards of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''250 Cat Food'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''5 Rare Tickets!'''}} Plus, collect limited special uniits [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Farmer Cat'''}}]] with your {{Color|#FF0000|'''3rd stamp'''}}, and [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Coin Cat'''}}]] with your {{Color|#0000FF|'''6th stamp'''}}!

※ After collecting Farmer Cat and Coin Cat, activate them at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ If you have previously collected Farmer Cat or Coin Cat from past events, you will not be able to collect them again.

